      "headline": "Milestone: caves to classics",
      "learned": [
        "Why who paid for art, the Church, the open market or royal courts, shaped what got made.",
        "How Baroque artists used diagonals, motion and illusion to stir strong feeling.",
        "How Caravaggio made light tell the story, and how Rembrandt and Vermeer used light their own ways.",
        "Why the playful Rococo gave way to the calm, straight lines of Neoclassicism."
